    "body": "```\r\n listOf(\r\n        iosX64(),\r\n        iosArm64(),\r\n        iosSimulatorArm64()\r\n    ).forEach { iosTarget ->\r\n        iosTarget.binaries.framework {\r\n            baseName = \"ComposeApp\"\r\n            isStatic = true\r\n\r\n            // IMPORTANT: Exporting calf-ui is required for some functionalities to work\r\n            export(libs.mohamedrejeb.calf.ui)\r\n        }\r\n    }\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nNow it is working, thanks.",
